---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Clinical Hypnotherapy in Kathmandu: How It Works" 
  description="Clinical hypnotherapy in Kathmandu explained: what it is, how a session works, safety, evidence, and what it can and cannot do."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Clinical Practice</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Clinical Hypnotherapy in Kathmandu</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Clinical hypnotherapy is psychotherapy delivered with hypnosis, a state of focused attention and deep relaxation. In a safe, structured setting, it helps some people work with stress, anxiety, habits and unhelpful thought patterns. You stay aware and in control throughout. 
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What hypnosis is</h2>
        <p>Hypnosis is not sleep and it is not mind control. The word comes from the Greek <em>hypnos</em> (sleep), but the name is misleading. In clinical hypnosis you are awake, you can hear and remember, and your attention is narrowed and focused. Your therapist guides you into this state, and you remain free to stop at any time.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">Myths and Facts</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[#FAF8F5] border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
                <th class="p-4 font-bold text-[#173A7A]">Myth</th>
                <th class="p-4 font-bold text-[#173A7A]">Fact</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-sm">
              <tr class="border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
                <td class="p-4">"I will be unconscious or asleep."</td>
                <td class="p-4">You are awake and aware throughout.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
                <td class="p-4">"The therapist can make me do anything."</td>
                <td class="p-4">You cannot be made to act against your will or values.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
                <td class="p-4">"It works instantly on everyone."</td>
                <td class="p-4">People respond differently, and results build over sessions.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4">"It is the same as stage hypnosis."</td>
                <td class="p-4">Stage hypnosis is entertainment. This is a structured therapeutic process.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What it may help with</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Anxiety, stress and tension</li>
          <li>Sleep difficulties</li>
          <li>Building confidence and self-esteem</li>
          <li>Changing habits</li>
          <li>Supporting other psychotherapy work, for example by making relaxation easier</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">It is not a cure-all, and it is not a replacement for medical or psychiatric treatment. For some concerns, such as severe depression or psychosis, other treatments come first, and we will say so.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What happens in a therapy session</h2>
        <ul class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Consultation and assessment:</strong> We talk through your goals, history and health concerns.</li>
          <li><strong>Preparation:</strong> We agree on what you want to work on.</li>
          <li><strong>Guided relaxation and focus:</strong> Your therapist guides you using voice and imagery.</li>
          <li><strong>Therapeutic work:</strong> Suggestions and exercises are tailored to your goal.</li>
          <li><strong>Returning and discussing:</strong> You come back to full awareness and talk about the experience.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">Will I lose control or say something embarrassing?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">No. You remain aware and can choose what to say or do, and you can stop at any time.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">Is hypnotherapy used in every session?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">No. It is one of several methods, used only when clinically appropriate.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">Can everyone be hypnotised?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">Most people can experience some degree of hypnosis, but responsiveness varies. If it does not suit you, we will use other approaches.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Not sure whether hypnotherapy is right for you?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-blue-100">Request a consultation and we will help you decide.</p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>